# Google Drive Configuration
# This is the folder ID for the Commish Tiers archive Google Drive folder
# The folder ID can be found in the Google Drive URL: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/{FOLDER_ID}
# Replace with your actual Google Drive folder ID that contains the Commish Tiers documents
